  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 300 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "In a large Dutch oven, heat the olive oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion, carrot, and celery, and cook until the vegetables are tender.",
    "Add the pork knuckle to the pot, and cook until browned on all sides.",
    "Cover the pot, and transfer to the preheated oven.",
    "Braise the pork for 2 hours, or until tender and easily shredded.",
    "Shred the pork, and season with salt and black pepper.",
    "Wrap the shredded pork in ti leaves, and serve warm."
